              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Small Molecules Can Be Designed to Inhibit Specific Oncogenic Proteins 1207  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Many Cancers May Be Treatable by Enhancing Immune Responses 1209  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Immunosuppression Is a Major Hurdle for Cancer Immunotherapy 1210  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Cancers Evolve Resistance to Therapies 1212  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "We Now Have the Tools to Devise Combination Therapies Tailored to the Individual 1212  "
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Summary 1213  "
                }
